{"seq":6,"slug":"controversies-and-appraisal","title":"王阳明·controversies-and-appraisal","stage":"DONE","category":"wang-yangming","categoryLabel":"王阳明","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal","rating":{"composite":3.76,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.33,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/24_wang-yangming/6_controversies-and-appraisal","introHtml":"<p>本 hub「争议与评价」对王阳明（1472–1529）作全面而辩证的评判：既正视围绕其心学的种种争议，也评价其作为&quot;知行合一的圣哲&quot;、三不朽完人的崇高地位。</p>\n<p><strong>本 hub vs 兄弟 hub 的分工</strong>：<a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a> 与 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a> 讲心学命题&quot;是什么&quot;；<a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a> 讲其人其事；<a href=\"../major-works/\">著作</a> 讲文本；<a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a> 讲后世传播。本 hub 不重复阐释命题，而专门处理&quot;这些命题与人物<strong>引发了哪些争议、又该如何评价</strong>&quot;——同一命题（如&quot;心外无物&quot;&quot;无善无恶&quot;）的正面义理交由兄弟 hub，本 hub 只辨其争议。</p>\n<p><strong>三章结构与推荐学习路径</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"debates-with-zhu-xi/\">朱王之辩</a> —— 与朱熹理学的正统之争、&quot;主观主义&quot;之疑；</li>\n<li><a href=\"debates/\">其他争议</a> —— &quot;近禅/狂禅&quot;之讥、事功与心性之辩；</li>\n<li><a href=\"overall-appraisal/\">综合评价</a> —— &quot;知行合一的圣哲&quot;三不朽、全面的评判。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>建议顺序：先读各章争议（第 1、2 章），再读第 3 章总评——因为总评中的 <a href=\"overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment\">全面的评判</a> 会把前面四组争议汇总成一张全局地图。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：阅读前最好先了解三大心学命题——<a href=\"../core-contributions/the-school-of-mind/mind-is-principle\">心即理</a>、<a href=\"../core-contributions/unity-of-knowing-and-acting/the-doctrine\">知行合一</a>、<a href=\"../core-contributions/innate-knowledge/extending-liangzhi\">致良知</a>，以及其平叛事功（<a href=\"../life-and-times/statesman-and-general/suppressing-rebellions\">平定叛乱</a>）。贯穿全 hub 的方法论是一条主线：<strong>区分&quot;王阳明本人&quot;与&quot;王学末流&quot;</strong>——多数尖锐批评真正指向的是后学流弊，而非王阳明本人。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"debates-with-zhu-xi","title":"Debates With Zhu Xi","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/debates-with-zhu-xi","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-orthodoxy-question","title":"朱王之辩与正统之争","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/debates-with-zhu-xi/the-orthodoxy-question"},{"seq":2,"slug":"subjectivism-charge","title":"主观主义之疑","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/debates-with-zhu-xi/subjectivism-charge"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"debates","title":"Debates","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/debates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-wild-chan-critique","title":"近禅之讥与狂禅流弊","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/the-wild-chan-critique"},{"seq":2,"slug":"action-and-quietism","title":"事功与心性之辩","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/action-and-quietism"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"Overall Appraisal","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-sage-of-mind-and-action","title":"知行合一的圣哲：三不朽之名","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-sage-of-mind-and-action"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判：贡献、争议与现代重估","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment"}]}]}